{"id":2663,"date":"2026-06-09T12:49:45","date_gmt":"2026-06-09T12:49:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2663"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:21:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:21:53","slug":"kota-brown-polish-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-brown-polish-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Kota Brown Polish Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"600\">Kota Brown Polish is a premium natural stone appreciated for its warm brown color, smooth polished surface, and timeless appeal. Its refined appearance makes it a preferred choice for architects, interior designers, builders, and homeowners looking to create sophisticated and durable spaces.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"906\">The polished finish enhances the natural beauty of the stone, bringing out its rich tones and subtle variations while adding a clean and elegant look. Whether used in residential, commercial, or institutional projects, Kota Brown Polish complements both contemporary and traditional architectural styles.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"908\" data-end=\"1203\">Known for its strength, durability, and low maintenance requirements, this natural stone performs exceptionally well in a variety of applications. Its natural charm and long-lasting performance make it suitable for creating visually appealing interiors and exteriors that stand the test of time.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1478\">Kota Brown in polished and other specialty finishes is relatively rare compared to standard Kota stone varieties, making it a unique selection for projects seeking a distinctive natural stone aesthetic. Availability may vary depending on quarry production and stock levels.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1483\" \/>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"11k4bfl\" data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1510\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1488\" data-end=\"1510\">Product Attributes<\/strong><